00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:33.770
This story is a work of fiction.

00:01:33.950 --> 00:01:37.450
June, 1590 - Musashi Province - Ishida Mitsunari's Stronghold - Mt. Maruhaka

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:44.310
This rain sunk Hōjō underwater.

00:01:45.810 --> 00:01:51.700
Tatebaya Castle at Jōshū has fallen already. Oshi Castle is within reach with our siege.

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:55.780
Then no one will question the ingenuity of our commander, Lord Ishida.

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:13.190
The dirt here lacks stickiness.

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:18.080
You're right. The dirt is not right to make pottery.

00:02:21.210 --> 00:02:24.250
Musashi has good metals but terrible dirt.

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:28.960
We made a levee with this dirt!?

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:40.630
Aesthete's Crossroad

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:48.840
Twenty locations on our levees have been breached!

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:04.030
What should we do, milord?

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:10.300
His Highness ordered a siege for us to win.

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:14.620
We are paying homage to the Siege of Takamatsu.

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:21.210
We must rebuild the levees and lay siege on Oshi!

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:24.370
I come with a message!

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:28.200
Lord Oribe wants to meet with you.

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:46.740
Thank goodness you're all right.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:52.130
I must return to Odawara and report the progress of the siege. That is my job.

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:59.020
You do not need to hide anything.
Tell His Highness what really happened.

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:05.640
I heard a spy from Hōjō is among the people building the levees.

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:13.940
That spy has been secretly taking food from the army granary into Oshi Castle.

00:04:15.640 --> 00:04:19.280
You don't even have their food supply cut off.

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:28.810
Lord Ishida, you're still young but you are working hard.

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:33.620
You follow orders from above and take initiative on difficult tasks.

00:04:34.410 --> 00:04:38.720
I have to applaud you in your land survey efforts.

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:41.730
But... 

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:47.030
The battlefield isn't all a game on paper.

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:51.680
If you want to lay a siege, you must inspect the surroundings yourself.

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:57.560
Dozens of my men lost their lives for me to tell you this.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:08.140
You have no right to talk to me in that tone, you tea-obsessed bastard.

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:12.380
You do have a good point there. But you know,

00:05:12.380 --> 00:05:16.640
even when I'm making new tea tools, I inspect where I get the materials with care.

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:20.170
The obsession makes the work come easy.

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:25.410
If you want to become an elite warrior,

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:28.230
then please do your job right.

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:41.020
Milord!

00:05:43.380 --> 00:05:45.240
Master Rikyū sent you a letter.

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:57.970
Note: 5-7-5-7-7 syllable poems incoming - sorry I can't make them 5-7-5-7-7 in English.

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:53.920
These Musashi Stirrups have traveled a long way.

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:57.970
Please do not ask their origin. I hope they bring you much joy.

00:05:58.470 --> 00:06:01.430
I have received the stirrups and your hilarious poem.

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:04.140
I thank you from the bottom of my heart.

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:07.650
Let me respond with a poem of my own.

00:06:08.990 --> 00:06:13.550
By sending these beautiful Musashi Stirrups,

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:17.530
you have acertained your loyalty, even if we are far, far apart.

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:22.170
Here are two more from me, up in the mountains.

00:06:22.870 --> 00:06:32.050
The sound of these flies annoy all, but the sound of my waving them off calms my heart.

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:39.990
When you hear those sounds yourself, then even Odawara can be called home.

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:44.830
Thank goodness Master loved the stirrups.

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:49.550
But the flies seem to be annoying him a lot.

00:06:58.650 --> 00:07:03.180
A vase with two openings! How fresh!

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:08.900
It's time to give our respects to our departed brothers, everyone!

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:11.870
I'll perform a tea ceremony for them! Get ready!

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:42.960
It's only tea from a simple wooden bowl,

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:45.670
but that taste when you realized you survived,

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:48.330
tingles to the very base of my soul.

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:52.220
Elegant, yet imperfect.

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:56.380
You've got it.

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:00.850
I hope the war can come to an end quickly.

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:04.030
I really hope when fall comes around again,

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:07.900
that we can have another big tea ceremony.

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:24.590
Images of myself displaying my new tea tools in front of Master and the Chief Advisor appear in front of my eyes.

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:28.310
Sagami Province - Hakone - Toyotomi Hideyoshi Stronghold - Sōun Temple

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:39.530
You've been brought up well.

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:42.940
You're the only one that can make me feel alive again, Chacha.

00:08:44.130 --> 00:08:46.770
I am about to be a mother soon.

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:51.250
I cannot maintain this figure forever.

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:55.110
Your breasts stick!

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:04.180
How is Tsurumatsu doing?

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:08.480
He's enjoying himself under the care of your wife, Kita no Mandokoro.

00:09:14.060 --> 00:09:16.670
Our attack of Hōjō is coming to an end.

00:09:16.880 --> 00:09:21.530
Peace will come to Ōu and then we'll prepare to invade China.

00:09:22.310 --> 00:09:25.870
If I am to think about Tsurumatsu eventually ruling over Japan,

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:30.440
then I must decide on where the commanders will go.

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:33.230
Ieyasu has agreed on changing the place of his rule.

00:09:33.650 --> 00:09:36.220
Oda Nobukatsu is the tough one to deal with.

00:09:37.270 --> 00:09:41.730
He'll deny that he's the second son of the late Nobunage, but it's as clear as day.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:48.580
As his cousin, can you do something about that?

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:51.580
I'm terrible at handling the Oda family.

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:54.790
Where's Lord Nobukatsu being transferred to?

00:09:54.970 --> 00:09:59.770
Nowhere far at all. The place close to Owari, and Ieyasu's old fort, Mikawa.

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:01.760
That may be close,

00:10:01.960 --> 00:10:05.510
but I do not think he'll give up Owari, the place the Oda family has ruled over for generations.

00:10:09.530 --> 00:10:14.690
Especially his uncle, Lord Oda Nagamasu, who's always with Nobukatsu.

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:19.880
Even if he has to go to Jurakudai often, he does not want to leave Kyoto.

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:22.330
Nagamasu, eh?

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:29.730
But for the sake of my son ruling over all, I'll do all I can.

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:34.890
As long as the world can change for the better.

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:44.430
You're too beautiful!

00:10:44.840 --> 00:10:49.820
Yes, yes! The world will become much more beautiful! I'll make it so!

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:53.830
End of June - Odawara Castle

00:10:54.510 --> 00:10:56.830
Lord Ujinao! Lord Ujinao!

00:10:57.360 --> 00:10:58.510
What is it?

00:10:59.140 --> 00:11:02.040
Lord Ujinao! Please take a look at the summit of Mt. Ishigaki!

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:05.120
There's a white casle there that appeared all of a sudden!

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:22.990
Impossible...

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:33.260
I admit defeat, Lord Ieyasu.

00:11:34.050 --> 00:11:38.260
I hope you can let my clan go by taking my life instead.

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:46.190
Hōjō Ujinao is Lord Ieyasu's son-in-law.

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:53.990
I heard he let him go but had his father, Ujimasa, commit seppuku.

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:57.420
Sagami Province - Toyotomi Hideyoshi Stronghold - Sōun Temple

00:11:58.490 --> 00:12:03.700
The war is over and all of the commanders have agreed on their new locations.

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:10.070
All except Lord Nobukatsu. He still rejects my persuasion.

00:12:12.470 --> 00:12:14.170
His Majesty is quite mad.

00:12:14.730 --> 00:12:17.290
I am still here to calm him down,

00:12:17.690 --> 00:12:22.140
but I'm afraid he'll get put under house arrest at Shimotsuke.

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:27.920
I'm sure you don't want to be punished along with him,

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:29.140
Lord Nagamasu?

00:12:31.070 --> 00:12:34.490
I already told Lord Nobukatsu to accept his new position.

00:12:35.630 --> 00:12:41.080
But I cannot persuade him if I don't feel like it myself.

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:43.340
Try again, you fool!

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:47.000
Now's your only chance to subside His Highness's anger!

00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:54.150
Well, Lord Nagamasu.

00:12:55.260 --> 00:12:57.110
I understand you well myself.

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:03.070
His Highness has less than ten years left.

00:13:05.270 --> 00:13:10.570
I can tell how weak he is by his nightly visits. He cannot hide it from me.

00:13:11.340 --> 00:13:17.000
When he dies, the heavens will belong to my son, Tsurumatsu.

00:13:17.870 --> 00:13:22.280
The Oda family will then rise from the ashes.

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:29.280
Just be patient and suck it in for a few more years.

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:33.700
His Highness may be obsessed with a world of imperfection now,

00:13:33.930 --> 00:13:36.950
but in a few years, the refined tastes of the foreigners will take over.

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:43.460
Won't that be a world beyond your wildest dreams?

00:13:51.740 --> 00:13:53.480
If the world truly walks that path,

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:57.500
you will rule out all tastes other than those of the foreigners.

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:03.840
What a boring woman you've become.

00:14:04.140 --> 00:14:04.930
What did you say!?

00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:09.140
I won't be able to relax under your rule, Ochacha.

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:15.510
From now on, I refuse to follow you.

00:14:15.930 --> 00:14:17.140
What are you saying!?

00:14:18.740 --> 00:14:22.750
I finally realized that I hate this sense of pressure.

00:14:23.680 --> 00:14:27.230
The way of imperfection is way too small.

00:14:27.780 --> 00:14:31.990
That is why I followed Takayama and tried to maintain the taste of a foreigner.

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:40.010
Everyone goes through pain to follow their true beliefs!

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:45.930
You're the same yourself, with that massive ambition.

00:14:54.220 --> 00:14:56.130
What are you planning on doing, Nagamasu!?

00:14:57.980 --> 00:15:01.750
You won't follow His Highness or me.

00:15:02.220 --> 00:15:06.480
Do you want to be exiled like Takayama!?

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:13.970
You're a warrior! A samurai!

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:17.570
Your job is to follow orders!

00:15:21.530 --> 00:15:25.500
Then I just have to forgo my way of war and release myself from these shackles.

00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:45.820
Thank you very much for all that you've done, Chief Advisor.

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:52.890
I shall henceforth throw away my name, Oda Nagamasu,

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:57.050
and live on as a monk named Murakusai.

00:16:01.760 --> 00:16:07.370
You don't want to be my retainer or a warrior any more?

00:16:09.340 --> 00:16:16.720
Just like how a goldfish cannot leave his pond, I am unable to leave Kyoto.

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:19.700
What does the name Muraku mean?

00:16:20.360 --> 00:16:25.060
I have lost all of my privileges, so my life will lose all fun, probably.

00:16:25.850 --> 00:16:33.000
As long as I can relax for the rest of my days, I do not need anything else.

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:36.760
No!

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:43.480
I have already decided to punsh Nobukatsu by putting him under house arrest at Shimotsuke.

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:49.960
I cannot allow you to just go into seclusion.

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:53.790
I will allow you to become a monk, however.

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:58.190
But you are to serve as my bantering partner for life!

00:16:58.590 --> 00:17:02.030
If you refuse my offer, then commit seppuku immediately!

00:17:11.570 --> 00:17:13.560
Come on now, Nagamasu.

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:17.970
You're the same as me. We both love women.

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:23.400
Even when we're over forty, we should not stop playing.

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:26.800
Don't choose such an unrealistic name.

00:17:27.410 --> 00:17:29.680
Let me give you a better name.

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:33.730
You're Oda Jurakusai!

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:36.230
You'll bring eternal fun to me!

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:51.010
What a disgustingly wonderful name.

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:53.860
But now...

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:58.750
Even a small comfort is worth diamonds.

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:05.070
Let me change it to Urakusai, please.

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:22.180
That haircut just removed all of your swagger.

00:18:22.530 --> 00:18:27.960
I guess you'll be luring the women with your scriptures rather than your libido.

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:29.390
Right, Lord Jurakusai?

00:18:33.020 --> 00:18:39.620
Goodness. If I had known he would give me such a flattering name,

00:18:39.880 --> 00:18:42.420
I would have rather committed seppuku.

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:49.630
But you get to stay in Kyoto and serve as his bantering partner.

00:18:50.280 --> 00:18:53.940
I guess he does treat the Oda family with care.

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:56.060
I wonder about that.

00:18:58.240 --> 00:19:03.390
Well, I have it much easier than Lord Gamō, who got moved to Aizu.

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:08.480
I don't think I can forgo the way of the warrior.

00:19:08.680 --> 00:19:12.370
I have to go where I'm told, no matter how far.

00:19:12.720 --> 00:19:16.970
Beware of Date, Lord Gamō.

00:19:17.150 --> 00:19:19.910
He will ambush anyone.

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:23.920
This guy got an axe on his back and fell into the river.

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:27.480
You sure went all out during the war.

00:19:32.800 --> 00:19:34.340
But this hot springs isn't bad.

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:37.810
We've finally taken care of Kanto.

00:19:38.020 --> 00:19:41.100
Only the little things are left.

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:44.780
Why don't we invite Master for a dip, too?

00:19:45.400 --> 00:19:49.150
We have to go to Ōu soon to maintain the peace.

00:19:49.320 --> 00:19:50.520
There won't be another chance.

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:52.640
That's a great idea!

00:19:52.850 --> 00:19:55.160
A hot springs does wonders to the sick.

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:56.430
Juraku...

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:02.730
Would you like to come with us, Lord Urakusai?

00:20:03.580 --> 00:20:04.890
I'm fine.

00:20:05.360 --> 00:20:12.050
I want to return to Kyoto quickly and pay my respects to Araki Dōfun.

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:14.880
I see.

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:20.420
You want to live like he did?

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:23.330
Tell him this.

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:28.440
Even in old age, I am greedy until the end.

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:41.600
To be a warrior or an aesthete?

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:48.580
I think it's finally time I have to make a decision.

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:58.220
Beginning of July - Kyoto - Ichijō Modori Bridge

00:21:05.420 --> 00:21:07.110
Hōjō Ujimasa.

00:21:07.300 --> 00:21:08.410
How terrible.

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:13.750
They had his head sent all the way here from Odawara.

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:17.860
His son Ujinao kept his life, though.

00:21:17.970 --> 00:21:22.440
Seems like no one can go up against the Chief Advisor anymore.

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:38.660
I will not blame you for your failure at Oshi Castle.

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:44.310
We're heading into Ōu next, then China.

00:21:44.310 --> 00:21:45.870
Don't screw up.

00:21:54.170 --> 00:21:55.830
As you wish.

00:22:01.450 --> 00:22:05.510
Chief Councilor Tokugawa is entering the castle!

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:20.990
We have to tear down the mountains, divert the rivers, build the houses, and lure the merchants.

00:22:21.590 --> 00:22:24.590
We'll be busy, Tadakatsu.

00:22:25.760 --> 00:22:30.900
I can sense that you're quite happy, though.

00:22:31.850 --> 00:22:34.760
I may not be able to feel the elegance of a tea bowl's glaze,

00:22:35.110 --> 00:22:38.880
or understand the intentions of building a mountain residence in a city.

00:22:39.480 --> 00:22:41.510
But according to my common sense and experience,

00:22:41.660 --> 00:22:45.860
to be part of building something new brings me indescribable joy.

00:22:52.420 --> 00:22:57.990
Perhaps this is my form of elegance.

00:23:03.700 --> 00:23:06.430
Everytime I　

00:23:03.700 --> 00:23:06.430
Anata no mune

00:23:06.590 --> 00:23:08.820
feel your heart

00:23:06.590 --> 00:23:08.820
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.550 --> 00:23:14.910
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.550 --> 00:23:14.910
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.830 --> 00:23:21.090
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.830 --> 00:23:21.090
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:21.940 --> 00:23:27.250
Oppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:21.940 --> 00:23:27.250
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:33.340
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:33.340
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.340 --> 00:23:37.220
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.340 --> 00:23:37.220
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.450 --> 00:23:40.800
Are also alike, we all choose to live.

00:23:37.450 --> 00:23:40.800
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:41.000 --> 00:23:46.670
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:41.000 --> 00:23:46.670
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.770 --> 00:23:49.670
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.770 --> 00:23:49.670
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.750 --> 00:23:52.280
Without each other.

00:23:49.750 --> 00:23:52.280
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.370 --> 00:23:53.240
You should

00:23:52.370 --> 00:23:53.240
Soshite

00:23:53.330 --> 00:23:58.740
Ascend the heavens and look below.

00:23:53.330 --> 00:23:58.740
Nobotta itadakikara mieru

00:23:58.850 --> 00:24:02.530
Show me the scenery in my dreams.

00:23:58.850 --> 00:24:02.530
Keshiki wo oshiete itsuka

00:24:02.590 --> 00:24:08.240
Even though we fall in love and drown in passion,

00:24:02.590 --> 00:24:08.240
Koi ni ochiteku ai ni oboreteku

00:24:08.320 --> 00:24:14.730
I desire my wish fulfilled, above this happiness we both share.

00:24:08.320 --> 00:24:14.730
Watashi no kono shiawase yori kanaetai negai sore wa

00:24:14.790 --> 00:24:20.530
I desire your pursuit of beautiful things.

00:24:14.790 --> 00:24:20.530
Anata no ou utsukushii mono

00:24:22.010 --> 00:24:26.510
So abide by my desire, for eternity.

00:24:22.010 --> 00:24:26.510
Kowasarenaide eien ni

00:24:36.080 --> 00:24:37.870
Don't get involved with me, Lord Furuori!

00:24:42.770 --> 00:24:44.270
Bling!

00:24:48.560 --> 00:24:50.070
Words cannot describe this properly.

00:24:50.690 --> 00:24:53.300
The Shadow Tea King.

00:24:54.230 --> 00:24:55.540
To be a warrior or an aesthete?

00:24:55.770 --> 00:24:58.050
That is the question.

00:24:56.480 --> 00:24:59.770
The Shadow Tea King
